--------------------- MoorDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Rod with thrust in negative x direction.The
attachment event withholds that line's load from the mooring until the trigger
time, then ramps it in, so the mooring runs undisturbed first and the
attachment loads it smoothly. The gear then parts at t = 80 s.
